      "sourceText": "1. 线程什么时候开始、什么时候结束，谁负责等待它？\n2. 线程函数拿到的参数是副本、引用还是指针？对象会不会提前销毁？\n3. 多个线程同时访问同一份数据时，怎样避免数据竞争？\n4. 多把锁同时使用时，怎样避免死锁？\n5. 一个线程没有工作时，怎样高效等待，而不是一直循环占用 CPU？\n6. 一个任务将在未来产生结果时，怎样取得它的返回值或异常？\n7. 程序退出时，怎样让后台线程安全停止？",
      "translatedText": "1. When does a thread start and when does it end, and who is responsible for waiting for it?\n2. Are the parameters received by the thread function copies, references, or pointers? Could the object be destroyed early?\n3. When multiple threads access the same data simultaneously, how can data races be avoided?\n4. When multiple locks are used at the same time, how can deadlock be avoided?\n5. When a thread has no work to do, how can it wait efficiently instead of looping continuously and consuming CPU?\n6. When a task will produce a result in the future, how can its return value or exception be obtained?\n7. When the program exits, how can background threads be stopped safely?",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 230,
        "outputTokens": 143,
        "costUsd": 0.000241
      }
    },
